      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so i had the flu like 3 weeks ago and i thought i was totally fine, but lately i've been feeling super wiped out. like even just walking up the stairs to my apartment makes me feel breathless and my heart starts racing like crazy. sometimes my chest feels heavy too. is this just normal post-flu fatigue or something? i'm kinda worried but also i don't want to waste time at a doctor if it's just a lingering virus.",
